    {
      "id": "p0077-b019",
      "kind": "caption",
      "source": {
        "text": "In text-heavy games, fonts can shape the way a game \"feels\" just as much as its art and sound (note: for display purposes, the Undertale fonts here aren't to scale)",
        "raw": "In text-heavy games,\nfonts can shape the\nway a game \"feels\"\njust as much as its art\nand sound (note: for\ndisplay purposes, the\nUndertale fonts here\naren't to scale)",
